    "reason": "[ev-01e97dc9c4df] says that removing the wildcard view permission \"may impact reports\" as well as mutate and generate policies on custom resources. The proposed exposure only covers mutate/generate policies, so it misses environments exposed through reports, which the reports controller's lost */* get/list/watch permissions confirm [ev-fbb2a078179b, ev-8034700c2e78, ev-2e7e175db33a]. Its undecidable leaf also uses an invalid reason, \"environment-visibility-gap\". The evidence never says which resources lose visibility, so that part stays undecidable (evidence-gap), joined with Kyverno policies being in use. No overlap is given because [ev-2bbc505de6bb] does not name the Helm values key that restores the wildcard permissions.",
